
GET http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json


###
### Error Simulation Examples
###

###
### Simulate database error on GET all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=db_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Simulate validation error on GET all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=validation_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Simulate overload error on GET all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=overload_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Simulate database error on GET product by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/1?simulateError=db_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Simulate validation error on CREATE product
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=validation_error
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "This will fail with validation error",
  "price": 100
}

###
### Simulate overload error on UPDATE product
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/products/1?simulateError=overload_error
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": 200
}

###
### Simulate database error on DELETE product
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/products/1?simulateError=db_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Test invalid error type (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=invalid_error
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Combine error simulation with pagination
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?page=1&pageSize=5&simulateError=overload_error
Content-Type: application/json


###
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products?simulateError=overload_error
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Product to overload",
  "description": "This will simulate overload error",
  "price": 150
}